        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;'we just lost to Baron Blade. AMAZING'</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is what makes a great villain deck. Gloom-ily (pun!), Gloomweaver hasn't done any of that awesome stuff yet.</p>",
