        "created_at": "2013-01-14T11:45:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a loss to Gloomweaver just this weekend, he played 3 Vast Followings from his deck in a single turn and followed up with the only relic still in his deck, the other 2 having been pulled out of his trash by the Vast Followings... we did not go down without a fight though.</p>",
